      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "守住这个招式好厉害，\n不论怎么被攻击都不会受到伤害！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
