      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但我更喜欢\n看穿这个招式！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n虽然守住能长时间守护宝可梦，\n但看穿更容易连续使出！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46621166F4559C6B22000A770B7A7F8FD94E2A62DB5F0FFF0100100001BE01000A867D71365B884F4F80FD957F65F695F45B8862A45B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A4F46770B7A7F66F45BB966138FDE7EED4F7F51FAFF0100100002011401470000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会教你看穿有多厉害的，\n请和我对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
